{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:27:23.749362+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We respect and appreciate that you have a strong in-house team; they are your core asset. This leads me to a question: given your deal flow, how does your team currently handle the inevitable overflow during sourcing spikes to avoid research backlogs?\n\nOur role is to provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity. We act as a flexible resource, allowing your core team to focus on top-priority diligence while we help clear the queue. All our analysis is grounded in a structured 6-Pillar DD Framework to ensure consistent, high-quality output that complements your team's work.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to discuss how we can provide this surge support for your analysts?"}
