{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:27:40.401852+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We respect and appreciate the value of a strong in-house team. That level of internal expertise is a critical asset.\n\nGiven your team's strength, how do you currently manage the inevitable research backlog that occurs during major deal flow spikes?\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity for precisely these situations, allowing your core analysts to focus on the highest-priority opportunities. Our methodology is based on the OrbLabs 6-Pillar Diligence Framework, covering aspects from tokenomics and protocol mechanics to on-chain forensics and technical security audits. This structured approach ensures comprehensive, decision-useful intelligence.\n\nShould you ever need to handle overflow, we can deliver a comprehensive report on a single target. A fixed-scope proof-of-concept engagement is available at our published list rate of $3,500, with 100% upfront payment required before work commences."}
