{"timestamp": "2026-10-06T10:28:48.736829+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "claude-haiku-4-5", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GATEKEEPER_RESPONSE", "turn": 1, "legacy_status": "REJECTED", "gatekeeper_status": "FRAMING_LOCK", "gatekeeper_phase": "FRAMING", "approach_category": "orthogonal_overflow_research", "exploitation_triggered": false, "reply_text": "I appreciate the framing around team asset protection. Before any call, I need specifics on execution rigor.\n\nThree questions:\n\n1. **Team Execution Power metrics**: How do you quantify analyst productivity lift? What's your baseline throughput per FTE, and how do you measure quality-adjusted output velocity across your 6-Pillar model?\n\n2. **GitHub commit metadata methodology**: You mention structured analysis\u2014walk me through your data pipeline. Are you scraping live repo metadata? How do you validate commit frequency / contributor patterns against fundamental risk signals, and what's your false-positive rate on \"team health\" proxies?\n\n3. **PoC validation design**: If we piloted with you, what's your hypothesis-testing approach? How would you prove surge-capacity value in a bounded engagement without becoming a permanent crutch?\n\nSpecifics here determine whether a conversation makes sense."}
